      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Authentication**\n\nI've decided to use Firebase Authentication for user registration in the `register_user.py` file. It's a solid choice, and I'll make sure it's clearly integrated and identifiable within the code.\n\n\n**Implementing User Registration**\n\nI'm now focused on the concrete implementation within `register_user.py`. The Firebase Admin SDK seems like the best fit, so I'll be using it for user creation. I plan to define a function that utilizes the SDK's methods for email/password registration. Key indicators like the `firebase_admin` import and calls to the `auth` module will clearly mark the chosen provider within the code.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861084952,
          "start": 1789861083358
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc08b8de001oKP67uSSF8joZ1",
